					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-9808528#post-4106323</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-9808528/para-pedigrees-ped464-can33-lup22#post-4106323</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Wed, 02 Jan 2019 18:26:19 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Captain Kirby</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>3440103</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Hmmm&#8230;</p> <p>I like the core idea, and the general direction you take the article but I feel like there’s not enough of an effort from MC&amp;D. While I like the idea that good press is important, I feel like there are more clever ways of dealing with the WWS problem, like trying to disctract the media with pointing out connections between WWS and the Foundation, or maybe by attempting to reframe the product as more of a utility than as a pet, or something. It felt like there were more options than the “wipe out wilson’s” method that they ignored, which makes them giving up at the end feel somewhat laconic for MC&amp;D.</p> <p>Just overall I would’ve wanted to see more struggle and more MC&amp;D sliminess. Not traditional slime but just some other attempt to quelch the counter campaign before giving up to show how cornered they really felt.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
