					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-9808528#post-4105562</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-9808528/para-pedigrees-ped464-can33-lup22#post-4105562</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Wed, 02 Jan 2019 00:07:55 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>DrChandra</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1956625</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I agree with Nico. MC&amp;D, especially the Darks, are very pragmatic. Acting like a gangster will get you in a gang war. Wilson's is allied with The Foundation, so it would be very stupid for MC&amp;D to antagonize them. MC&amp;D's use of violence and other immoral behaviour is precise and surgical, only done when it's the best of all available options. But whenever it's more profitable to be nice, they're perfectly civil.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
