					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-9808528#post-4105482</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-9808528/para-pedigrees-ped464-can33-lup22#post-4105482</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 01 Jan 2019 22:14:21 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Uncle Nicolini</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>3487700</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>So after writing a <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/reality-tv-designer-pets-and-fine-dining">tale</a> for Cy as a pinch hitter this last holiday gift exchange, I decided I wanted to try my hand at doing a GoI format set in the same canon the tale was. <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">I even lifted some ideas to boot!</span></p> <p>Anyway, big thanks to my critters and a special thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stormbreath" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3075960&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1546382024" alt="stormbreath" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3075960)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stormbreath" >stormbreath</a></span> for making me aware of this absolutely wonderful css (and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/silberescher" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=304355&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1546382024" alt="Silberescher" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=304355)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/silberescher" >Silberescher</a></span> for making it in the first place!), which is a lovely compromise between the typical MCD colors and the black you often see on BM content.</p> <p><span style="font-size:50%;">Also, it wouldn't be a Nico article without Wilson's Wildlife in it in some capacity.</span></p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
